<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-Esselte posts 4 pct rise H1 profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Esselte posts 4 pct rise H1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish office supplier Esselte posted on Wednesday  its results for the six months ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			    308   vs   296</p>
<p> Sales				     6,273   vs 5,695</p>
<p> Shr (crowns)			     5.80   vs  5.40</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			    308   vs   296</p>
<p> Sales				     6,273   vs 5,695</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold		    4,299   vs 3,811</p>
<p> Selling costs			   1,144   vs 1,080</p>
<p> Admin costs				 420   vs   390</p>
<p> Other costs				  88   vs    93</p>
<p> Operating profit			  322   vs   321</p>
<p> Net financial items	     CHARGE 14   vs    25 CHARGE</p>
<p> Tax					   111   vs   110</p>
<p> Net profit				  197   vs   186</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
